      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Julián Montoya goes off for HIA against Ireland and never returns",
          "body": "Argentina's skipper Julián Montoya went off for a head injury assessment on 28 minutes of Friday's 42-12 defeat in Dublin and never returned. His departure coincided with Hugo Keenan's second try, the first of what the match report calls endless forward disruptions. Leonel Oviedo came on for him, then went off for an HIA of his own on 36 minutes and returned on 40."
        },
        {
