        "name": "Rugby Asia 247"
      }
    },
    "465": {
      "date": "2026-11-09",
      "edition": "Monday 9 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coach backing",
          "heading": "Dave Rennie rejects 'past it' talk about Beauden Barrett after Scotland win",
          "body": "Rennie says the All Blacks kept Beauden Barrett at 15 and moved Damian McKenzie to 10 by design, a call that followed injuries to Ruben Love and Richie Mo'unga. Barrett, out of the reckoning at the start of the Test season, scored twice in Saturday's 43-21 win at Murrayfield. \"Everything we know about Beauden, I know there are people out there thinking that he's past it, but he's in an environment here where we really value his experience,\" Rennie said."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa thrash Italy 66-7",
          "body": "England's Immanuel Feyi-Waboso limps off with leg injury. France's Hastoy, Jalibert and Ramos all injured ahead of Springboks."
